        "quote": "(a) Except as provided in TMC 13.35.020(e) , unless an exception is granted pursuant to TMC 13.30.080(d) , the following activities shall be designed and constructed in conformance with this chapter and with the performance standard(s) applicable to the project as established in this section:",
