          "start": 294
        },
        "quote": "(1) Adherence to the stormwater quality performance standard shall be required for all requests for approval of subdivision plats and site plans pertaining to land development activities that will:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.35.010:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 13.35.010 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "c6eec7da-1112-562d-b977-eb8fe3c3b636",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 675,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.35.010:block:2",
          "start": 492
        },
        "quote": "(i) Disturb an area greater than or equal to one acre of land, including projects that will disturb less than one acre that are part of a larger common plan of development or sale; or",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.35.010:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 13.35.010 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "00a700b9-548b-5a6e-aafa-d626eea3a640",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 779,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.35.010:block:3",
          "start": 676
        },
        "quote": "(ii) Disturb less than one acre of land but will discharge stormwater runoff to an impacted water body.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.35.010:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 13.35.010 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "1efdde08-42e8-55ef-80ee-346b369cbe6f",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1152,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.35.010:block:4",
          "start": 780
        },
        "quote": "(2) Adherence to the stormwater quantity performance standard shall be required for all requests for approval of subdivision plats and site plans pertaining to land development activities that will result in a total of 10,000 square feet or more of impervious surface on the property, inclusive of any impervious surfaces currently located, and to remain, on the property.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.35.010:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 13.35.010 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "cde116ba-dd48-5c04-aa90-c49f9e56fd8a",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1645,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.35.010:block:5",
          "start": 1153
        },
        "quote": "(b) Requests for approval of subdivision plats and site plans that do not meet TMC 13.35.020(a) and (b) , but will result in concentrated flows, or will include buffer areas required by Chapter 17.10 TMC, or propose to change stormwater drainage patterns or discharge points from their pre-project conditions shall comply with TMC 13.35.050 and 13.35.070 and may be subject to additional stormwater requirements as deemed necessary by the Director to prevent pollution, erosion, and flooding.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.35.010:block:5#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 13.35.010 block 6",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 6,
          "component_id": "bd678cdb-97ba-5c46-9bc7-c668aab2f8fe",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
