          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.35.010:block:6",
          "start": 1646
        },
        "quote": "(c) Subdivision plats or site plans approved prior to January 1, 2021, shall be subject to orders, regulations, ordinances, rules, expiration dates, or other properly adopted requirements in effect at the time the original plat or plan was approved. (Ord. 20262 § 3, 10-6-20.)",
